1
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:03,796
This is Encore: a new tab in the Zara app.

2
00:00:03,796 --> 00:00:08,141
Bring your old Zara back, and earn your way into exclusive drops.

3
00:00:08,941 --> 00:00:09,963
Why it matters:

4
00:00:09,963 --> 00:00:12,416
about a hundred thousand Zara pieces

5
00:00:12,416 --> 00:00:14,528
are listed on Vinted every day,

6
00:00:14,528 --> 00:00:16,504
but secondhand has no status.

7
00:00:16,504 --> 00:00:18,889
When Zara dropped Galliano Re-form,

8
00:00:18,889 --> 00:00:21,138
it sold out in under ten minutes.

9
00:00:21,138 --> 00:00:24,658
Encore gives worn clothes that same drop energy.

10
00:00:26,158 --> 00:00:27,846
Here's what it gives you.

11
00:00:27,846 --> 00:00:32,166
Every Tuesday, an Archive Drop opens with three kinds of pieces:

12
00:00:32,166 --> 00:00:34,799
graded Zara vintage from 2010 to today,

13
00:00:34,799 --> 00:00:36,689
one-off re-cut editions made

14
00:00:36,689 --> 00:00:41,192
from returned clothes, and early access to the next collection.

15
00:00:42,692 --> 00:00:44,315
It all runs on three things.

16
00:00:44,315 --> 00:00:45,880
Keys get you into the drop.

17
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,562
Points rank you in your city.

18
00:00:47,562 --> 00:00:50,942
And your tier gives you perks, like skipping the line.

19
00:00:55,042 --> 00:00:58,338
When you first open Encore, pick your city, choose whether

20
00:00:58,338 --> 00:01:01,543
to share photos, and confirm you're sixteen or over.

21
00:01:02,993 --> 00:01:05,905
Your home shows your keys and city rank at the top,

22
00:01:05,905 --> 00:01:07,732
the next drop, and four actions:

23
00:01:07,732 --> 00:01:10,837
bring a piece back, swipe, looks, and your league.

24
00:01:14,887 --> 00:01:16,325
Step one: earn a key.

25
00:01:16,325 --> 00:01:20,844
In store, scan the care label of any Zara piece, in any condition.

26
00:01:20,844 --> 00:01:22,327
No receipt needed.

27
00:01:23,777 --> 00:01:26,769
Confirm the garment, rate its condition honestly,

28
00:01:26,769 --> 00:01:28,485
and find the Encore Bin.

29
00:01:29,935 --> 00:01:30,550
Drop it in.

30
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:32,980
The bin weighs it and checks the label.

31
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:37,016
You get one Archive Key, plus fifty points,

32
00:01:37,016 --> 00:01:39,672
and a second key if the hub grades it A.

33
00:01:40,472 --> 00:01:43,656
Every key you earn and spend is logged in your wallet.

34
00:01:43,656 --> 00:01:46,839
You can earn up to ten a month, and keys never expire,

35
00:01:46,839 --> 00:01:49,447
have no cash value, and can't be bought.

36
00:01:50,247 --> 00:01:52,809
Back in the app, you can follow your garment's lot,

37
00:01:52,809 --> 00:01:55,169
and you're told when it finds a new owner.

38
00:01:59,219 --> 00:02:02,117
Step two: Style Swipe. You get twenty cards a day.

39
00:02:02,117 --> 00:02:03,856
Tap the heart to hype a piece,

40
00:02:03,856 --> 00:02:06,424
and you'll get a reminder when it drops.

41
00:02:07,874 --> 00:02:08,773
Pass on the rest.

42
00:02:08,773 --> 00:02:12,092
There are no streaks, so skipping a day costs you nothing.

43
00:02:15,492 --> 00:02:17,047
Step three: the community.

44
00:02:17,047 --> 00:02:20,157
Post outfits with your Encore pieces to earn points,

45
00:02:20,157 --> 00:02:22,441
and see what your city is wearing.

46
00:02:23,891 --> 00:02:26,253
Every user has a closet, like on Depop.

47
00:02:26,253 --> 00:02:29,585
Follow people whose style you like, ask them about fit,

48
00:02:29,585 --> 00:02:31,523
and shop what they brought back,

49
00:02:31,523 --> 00:02:33,954
or what they sell on Zara Pre-Owned.

50
00:02:35,404 --> 00:02:37,574
Curators get their status from taste

51
00:02:37,574 --> 00:02:39,814
and returns, never from spending.

52
00:02:40,614 --> 00:02:42,845
And every garment anyone in Madrid

53
00:02:42,845 --> 00:02:45,470
brings back counts toward one city goal.

54
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:49,145
Each milestone unlocks something Zara does for the city:

55
00:02:49,145 --> 00:02:52,294
a free repair weekend, paid training at Caritas,

56
00:02:52,294 --> 00:02:56,416
a re-cut edition the city votes on, and ten thousand trees.

57
00:02:57,216 --> 00:03:00,602
In a Style Battle, two looks face off and your city votes.

58
00:03:02,052 --> 00:03:05,609
The winner earns twenty points, and a spot on the store screens.

59
00:03:09,659 --> 00:03:12,586
Step four: your City League. Points from returns,

60
00:03:12,586 --> 00:03:16,349
looks and fit notes rank you against fifty people in your city.

61
00:03:16,349 --> 00:03:18,271
Spending never earns points.

62
00:03:19,071 --> 00:03:22,159
Every week, the top ten in your league move up a tier.

63
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:23,989
Thread is where everyone starts,

64
00:03:23,989 --> 00:03:26,162
with the daily deck and the city feed.

65
00:03:26,162 --> 00:03:28,678
Stitch adds fit notes from owners your size.

66
00:03:28,678 --> 00:03:31,937
Seam gives you the skip-the-line pass, ten minutes early.

67
00:03:31,937 --> 00:03:35,139
Cut adds a bonus key every month and Style Battle entry.

68
00:03:35,139 --> 00:03:38,513
And Archive, the top five percent of your city each season,

69
00:03:38,513 --> 00:03:40,743
gets bonus keys, the city Encore night,

70
00:03:40,743 --> 00:03:42,937
and first look at re-cut editions.

71
00:03:44,437 --> 00:03:47,168
Reach Seam, and your skip-the-line pass shows up,

72
00:03:47,168 --> 00:03:48,421
ready for Tuesday.

73
00:03:51,821 --> 00:03:53,139
Step five: the drop.

74
00:03:53,139 --> 00:03:55,250
Every Tuesday, three lanes open,

75
00:03:55,250 --> 00:03:57,873
and each lane has its own key price.

76
00:03:58,673 --> 00:04:00,211
Here's how buying works.

77
00:04:00,211 --> 00:04:03,031
A key gets you in, and money buys the piece.

78
00:04:03,031 --> 00:04:04,441
Vintage takes one key:

79
00:04:04,441 --> 00:04:08,542
grade A sells at the original price, grade B at seventy percent.

80
00:04:08,542 --> 00:04:12,130
First access takes three keys, and re-cut editions five.

81
00:04:12,130 --> 00:04:15,841
Keys can't be bought, and nothing is ever marked down.

82
00:04:17,341 --> 00:04:19,317
Quantities are stated up front.

83
00:04:19,317 --> 00:04:21,166
No countdown, and no restock.

84
00:04:21,166 --> 00:04:23,265
Tap a piece to see its story.

85
00:04:24,715 --> 00:04:27,750
Each piece shows its number, grade and fit notes.

86
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:31,344
One key, plus thirty-nine ninety-five, and it's yours.

87
00:04:32,794 --> 00:04:33,307
You're in.

88
00:04:33,307 --> 00:04:36,539
And the person who brought it back is told it found its encore.

89
00:04:36,539 --> 00:04:37,609
That's the loop.

90
00:04:39,209 --> 00:04:41,314
Bring it back. Swipe. Climb. Unlock.

91
00:04:41,314 --> 00:04:42,382
That's Encore.

